---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT a FROM t WHERE b = 'x' AND c > (SELECT avg(u.a) FROM u WHERE u.a = t.a)"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, ((a#0 == a#3) and (CAST(c#2 AS DOUBLE) > avg(a)#5))
   :- Project [a#0, c#2]
   :  +- Filter (b#1 == 'x')
   :     +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1, c#2] (shared #1)
   +- Aggregate [a#3], [avg(a#3) AS avg(a)#5, a#3]
      +- Join LeftSemi, (a#3 == a#6)
         :- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
         +- Shift +6
            +- Project [a#0]
               +- Filter (b#1 == 'x')
                  +- Shared #1, printed above
